codex
The frozen target contains two loop-summary rules that Stage 3 correctly classified as domain lemmas, and the Lean rewrite relation deliberately excludes them. So the proof cannot legitimately invoke a generated “whole-loop” constructor; it has to compose ordinary Python execution rules. I confirmed the current proof state is now past the first symbolic local-variable lookup, which is the first nontrivial generated-rule application.
exec
